    "message": "Arena/a8ac5475 osb (#7)\n\n* R24 continuation: persistent native tabletop, offline atlas, local media and input rearm\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R24 continuation: repair native evidence harness and strengthen actual font/input gates\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R24 continuation: fix measured top-bar targets and native workflow regressions\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add pinned real Servo Android artifact intake without loading the engine\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R24 continuation: close map input dialog, verify native keyboard focus, retain real frames\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Preserve native window geometry across dialog IME and keep the atlas canvas usable\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Verify native frame transport within actual annotation limits and stage privacy lab readiness\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Explicitly export actual privacy readiness observations from managed emulators\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Keep CSV preview status truthful and verify one real system-save touch\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Bind native captures to committed window frames and retain failure-specific UI diagnostics\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Wait for actual native editable publication without retrying task actions\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R25: stage actual disposable UI readiness and test a real asleep-AVD boundary\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R25: submit pinned actual LibreOfficeKit WASM canary experiment\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Keep generated experiment caches out of source control\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Expose the actual pinned office archive intake failure without weakening its gates\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Validate the exact upstream office archive metadata without admitting arbitrary files\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Retain actual LOK document-load error and distinguish initialization from conversion\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R25: add bounded PNG metadata-copy kernel, isolated worker and explicit new-file workflow\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Stage actual office files on the runtime filesystem owner while retaining worker LOK calls\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Preserve exact independent Office readback and rendered-tile failure diagnostics\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Retain the actual Office page overview and test a declared readable-scale tile\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R25: repair PNG native intake and add real video and production Office-adapter experiments\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* R25: recognize native image-picker tiles and bind the completed Office subset census\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: jyvplay <15022593+jyvplay@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+a